          How does Teamwork Commerce achieve 99.9% inventory accuracy?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Through the industry's only native end-to-end RFID stack. RFID-powered cycle counts scan thousands of items in minutes without pulling product off racks. Real-time reconciliation updates global stock levels instantly. Combined with AI anomaly detection that flags suspicious inventory movement, this eliminates ghost SKUs and delivers 99.9% accuracy across all locations.</p></div>
